{"id":26489,"date":"2023-05-31T07:00:00","date_gmt":"2023-05-31T14:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.digilens.com\/?p=26489"},"modified":"2025-06-12T15:34:48","modified_gmt":"2025-06-12T22:34:48","slug":"pr-argo-snapdragon-spaces","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.digilens.com\/pr-argo-snapdragon-spaces\/","title":{"rendered":"DigiLens ARGO\u2122 to Support Snapdragon Spaces\u200b"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"26489\" class=\"elementor elementor-26489\" data-elementor-post-type=\"post\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-791a651a e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"791a651a\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b3b4056 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"b3b4056\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">DigiLens ARGO\u2122 to Support Snapdragon Spaces<\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-588ef0d5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"588ef0d5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Global Industry Leader in Extended Reality to Launch an All-In-One Snapdragon Spaces Ready AR Device, ARGO, Designed for Enterprise and Industrial-Lite Workers<\/h5>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7ac6aebe e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"7ac6aebe\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2030c2ed elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"2030c2ed\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Sunnyvale, CA \u2013 May 31, 2023:<\/strong> DigiLens Inc., a global leader in waveguide display technologies and headworn smartglasses for enterprise and industrial use cases, today announces plans to integrate Snapdragon Spaces\u2122 XR Developer Platform on the DigiLens ARGO\u2122 device.<\/p><p>ARGO is one of the first purpose-built, all-in-one Snapdragon Spaces Ready AR smartglasses powered by the Snapdragon\u00ae XR2 Platform. DigiLens ARGO features Qualcomm\u00ae FastConnect\u2122 6900 Mobile Connectivity System and inside-out tracking capabilities, which will enable developers to create true connected immersive 3D AR experiences. ARGO also features DigiLens\u2019 best-in-class crystal waveguide lenses with industry-leading efficiency, eye glow and footprint. Crystal waveguides are daylight bright for inside and outside use, resulting in a more user-friendly and socially acceptable product. ARGO improves communication and collaboration by creating a digitally-enabled workforce across a range of industries while maintaining body position independence and hands-free operations.<\/p><p>Snapdragon Spaces offers proven technology and an open, cross-device horizontal platform and ecosystem to bring developers\u2019 ideas to life and revolutionize the possibilities of headworn AR.<\/p><p><strong>Snapdragon Spaces key features include:<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>Positional tracking<\/li><li>Image recognition<\/li><li>Local anchors and persistence<\/li><li>Plane detection<\/li><li>Spatial mapping and meshing<\/li><li>Occlusion<\/li><li>Scene understanding<\/li><li>Hand tracking<\/li><\/ul><p>DigiLens\u2019 industrial-grade platform opens up rich XR features to the industrial workforce, including embedded OpenXR and WebXR, unique UI\/UX (for hand gestures), and full-scale room mapping.<\/p><p>\u201cQualcomm Technologies has always been a stalwart in the XR industry. They have been at the forefront of connectivity and, with the XR series of processors, empowered the XR industry with the integrated compute necessary for this next generation platform of compute. Now with Snapdragon Spaces, they have pushed the XR space forward and gives our line of industrial products the spatial compute and UI\/UX essential to empower frontline workers. We at DigiLens are truly excited, through ARGO, to provide the next-generation compute platform with the next-generation AR software,\u201d said Nima Shams, GM and VP of Product Business Unit for DigiLens.<\/p><p>\u201cWe are excited to support the democratization of the XR industry by offering Snapdragon Spaces through DigiLens\u2019 leading all-in-one AR headset,\u201d said Said Bakadir, Senior Director, Product Management, XR at Qualcomm Technologies, Inc. \u201cDigiLens\u2019 high-transparency and sunlight-readable optics combined with the universe of leading XR application developers from Snapdragon Spaces are critical in supporting the needs of the expanding enterprise and industrial markets.\u201d<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-78b149cb e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"78b149cb\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2039f81 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"2039f81\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">###<\/h5>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2f74c307 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"2f74c307\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-53b06565 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"53b06565\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\" eplus-wrapper\"><b>About DigiLens Inc.<br \/><\/b><span style=\"font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit;\">DigiLens is a leader in holographic waveguides used for XR displays. The company has developed a patented optical platform and photopolymer technology that deliver best-in-class solutions using a unique, low-cost contact-copy manufacturing process. DigiLens enables OEM partners to design and build XR-enabled devices for the global automobile, enterprise, consumer, avionics, and defense industries. Based in Sunnyvale, CA, DigiLens\u2019 investors include industry leaders like Samsung Electronics, Samsung Electro-Mechanics, Diamond Edge Ventures, the strategic investment arm of Mitsubishi Chemical Holdings Corporation, Alsop Louie Partners, Optimas Capital Management, 37 Interactive Entertainment, UDC Ventures, the corporate venture arm of Universal Display Corporation, Niantic, Inc., Sony Innovation Fund, Dolby Family Ventures, Continental AG, and more. <\/span>For more information, visit <a href=\"http:\/\/www.digilens.com\">www.digilens.com<\/a><\/p><p class=\" eplus-wrapper\"><em>Press Contact<\/em><br \/>Brian Hamilton<br \/><a href=\"mailto:brian.hamilton@DigiLens.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Brian.Hamilton@DigiLens.com<\/a><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t